@startuml SEQ_20_MELIHAT_PRESENSI
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-20: Melihat Presensi Praktikan & Asisten

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "PraktikumController"              as Controller
entity      "Absensi Model"                    as ModelA
database    "absensi_praktikum"                as DB

== Melihat Presensi Praktikan ==

Actor   ->  Browser    : Buka menu Rekap Praktikum, pilih praktikum
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/rekap
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman dengan tab Presensi & Nilai
Browser    --> Actor   : Halaman rekap dengan dua tab

Actor   ->  Browser    : Klik tab "Presensi"
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/rekap-presensi
Controller -> ModelA   : Query data absensi praktikum
ModelA -> DB           : SELECT absensi_praktikum JOIN users, pertemuan WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB --> ModelA          : Data absensi praktikan
ModelA --> Controller  : Data absensi praktikan
Controller -> DB       : SELECT absensi_aslab JOIN users, pertemuan WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB --> Controller      : Data absensi aslab
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman rekap presensi
Browser --> Actor      : Tampil tabel presensi\n(praktikan & asisten)

@enduml
